{"id": "1971213", "name": "מציאת גבול עליון/תחתון של סדרה 5", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div title=\"BGU_STACK_V5\" dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;margin:0 auto;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#1f2937;line-height:1.65;text-align:right;\">\n<div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:16px 18px;margin-bottom:18px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:10px;\">גבול עליון וגבול תחתון</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#665f6b;margin-top:3px;\">הפרדת האיבר המתנדנד מן האיברים המתכנסים</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:16px 18px;margin-bottom:16px;\"><div>נתונה הסדרה</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center;font-size:18px;margin:8px 0;\">\\(\\displaystyle a_n={{CT:0}}+\\sqrt[n]{n^{{CT:1}}}+{{CT:2}}\\)</div>\n<div>חשבו את הגבול העליון ואת הגבול התחתון.</div></div><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border:1px solid #EEECEF;border-radius:10px;padding:14px;margin-bottom:12px;\"><table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:separate;border-spacing:0 8px;margin-top:8px;\">\n<tr><td style=\"width:58%;padding:10px 12px;background:#F5F1F8;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;text-align:right;\">\\(\\displaystyle \\overline{\\lim}a_n\\)</td><td dir=\"ltr\" style=\"padding:10px 12px;background:#F5F1F8;border-radius:8px 0 0 8px;text-align:center;\">[[input:ans3]]<div style=\"margin-top:10px;padding-top:9px;border-top:1px solid #EEECEF;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:bold;color:#665f6b;margin-bottom:4px;\">בדיקת ההקלדה</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:isolate;text-align:center;\">[[validation:ans3]]</div></div></td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;background:#F5F1F8;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;text-align:right;\">\\(\\displaystyle \\underline{\\lim}a_n\\)</td><td dir=\"ltr\" style=\"padding:10px 12px;background:#F5F1F8;border-radius:8px 0 0 8px;text-align:center;\">[[input:ans4]]<div style=\"margin-top:10px;padding-top:9px;border-top:1px solid #EEECEF;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:bold;color:#665f6b;margin-bottom:4px;\">בדיקת ההקלדה</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:isolate;text-align:center;\">[[validation:ans4]]</div></div></td></tr>\n</table></div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:16px 18px;margin-bottom:16px;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#665f6b;\">כל תשובה נבדקת בנפרד ומזכה במחצית הניקוד.</div></div>\n</div>", "generalfeedback": "<div title=\"BGU_STACK_V5\" dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;margin:0 auto;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#1f2937;line-height:1.65;text-align:right;\">\n<div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:16px 18px;margin-bottom:18px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:10px;\">פתרון</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#665f6b;margin-top:3px;\">הפרדת רכיבי הסדרה</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:16px 18px;margin-bottom:16px;\"><p>שני האיברים שאינם מתנדנדים מקיימים</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center;\">\\(\\displaystyle \\sqrt[n]{n^{{CT:1}}}=e^{{{CT:1}}\\ln n/n}\\longrightarrow1\\)</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center;\">\\(\\displaystyle \\frac{\\sin\\left({{CT:3}}n\\right)}{{{CT:4}}n}\\longrightarrow0\\)</p>\n<p>לכן \\(\\displaystyle a_n-\\left({{CT:5}}\\left(-1\\right)^n+1\\right)\\to0\\). על האיברים הזוגיים מתקבל הגבול \\(\\displaystyle {{CT:6}}\\), ועל האיברים האי־זוגיים מתקבל \\(\\displaystyle {{CT:7}}\\).</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center;\">\\(\\displaystyle \\overline{\\lim}a_n={{CT:8}},\\;\\; \\underline{\\lim}a_n={{CT:9}}\\)</p></div>\n</div>", "specificfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"margin-top:12px;\">[[feedback:Result]]</div>", "prtcorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"correct\">תשובה נכונה.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"partially\">התשובה נכונה חלקית.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"incorrect\">התשובה אינה נכונה.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans3", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 5, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans4", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 5, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "Result", "value": 1, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 2, "nodes": [{"name": 2, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans3", "tans": "correct_answer_limsup", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0.5, "nextnode": 3, "answernote": "Result-3-T", "feedback": "<p dir=\"rtl\">הגבול העליון נכון.</p>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 3, "answernote": "Result-3-F", "feedback": "<p dir=\"rtl\">הגבול העליון אינו נכון.</p>"}}, {"name": 3, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans4", "tans": "correct_answer_liminf", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0.5, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-4-T", "feedback": "<p dir=\"rtl\">הגבול התחתון נכון.</p>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "-", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-4-F", "feedback": "<p dir=\"rtl\">הגבול התחתון אינו נכון.</p>"}}]}], "qvnames": ["al", "at", "bt", "correct_answer_liminf", "correct_answer_limsup", "k", "l1", "l2"], "nvariants": 50}